    "this repository by scraper/fixtures/ashfall/build-pages.mjs — no bitmaps, no",
    "base64, nothing fetched. They ship in the repo so the image reader can be",
    "demonstrated with the network off.",
    "An image chapter lists page files instead of blocks; paths are relative to",
    "scraper/fixtures/ and are copied beside the chapter files at build time."
